<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-5725] After turning on the email alert configuration, the operation task prompts an unknown error, and the query underpressing also reports an error.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5725</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Steps to Reproduce&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1:Configure to enable email alerts&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2:Create a model and initiate a build task.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;3:In the task list operation task restart, pause, terminate&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;4:Query sql, expect query downpressure&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Actual result&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;3:Operation error report&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;4:Query error&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13558248">KYLIN-5725</key>
            <summary>After turning on the email alert configuration, the operation task prompts an unknown error, and the query underpressing also reports an error.</summary>
